# Agent Local never reads keys from this file or from config.json.
# The setup wizard (Settings > Keys and accounts) saves each secret in its own file under
#   %APPDATA%\AgentLocal\secrets\   (readable by your Windows account only)
# This file only documents which files exist and what they contain. Never put real values here.
#
# openrouter.env   (Cloud advisor module)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_MODELE=
# telegram.env     (Telegram module : bot token from @BotFather)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# gmail.env / yahoo.env   (Mail module : mcp-email-server variables, app password, never your main password)
# n8n-cle-mcp.txt  (n8n module : the MCP access token copied from n8n settings, alone in the file)
